sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CSMS->>CS: SetDisplayMessageRequest (message.id = <Configured_Id>, message.state = <Configured State>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: SetDisplayMessageRequest<br>- message.id <Configured_Id><br>- message.state <Configured State>
    CS-->>CSMS: SetDisplayMessageResponse (status = Accepted)
